00:01:26.767 --> 00:01:29.033
I did not.
What I did was this.

00:01:29.033 --> 00:01:30.901
A lot of you
have been complaining

00:01:30.901 --> 00:01:33.167
about the YouTube playlist

00:01:33.167 --> 00:01:35.868
