in reverse order.

00:01:35.868 --> 00:01:38.167
So it plays
the most recent one first

00:01:38.167 --> 00:01:39.801
and then you're
watching it backwards.

00:01:39.801 --> 00:01:43.801
So what I did is a comedy
technique called a call forward.

00:01:43.801 --> 00:01:47.133
[ Laughter ]

00:01:47.133 --> 00:01:49.601
It's when comedians are aware
that their audience

00:01:49.601 --> 00:01:52.434
are watching their jokes
in reverse order.

00:01:52.434 --> 00:01:55.734
What you will do is place
something in the future

00:01:55.734 --> 00:01:58.734
that they will then
see in the past.

00:01:59.601 --> 00:02:02.067
