00:13:07.567 --> 00:13:10.567
-Where does he get those
wonderful toys?

00:13:10.567 --> 00:13:12.033
-See, that works.

00:13:12.033 --> 00:13:15.467
[ Laughter ]

00:13:15.467 --> 00:13:21.133
See how much better it is if the
Nicholson quote fits the setup?

00:13:21.133 --> 00:13:24.534
We just take this
as a teachable moment.

00:13:24.534 --> 00:13:28.133
You know, if we're on the same
page, the sky is the limit.

00:13:28.133 --> 00:13:29.734
What if...

00:13:32.167 --> 00:13:35.200
What if we could make this show
better every week?

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:37.234
-What if this
is as good as it gets?

00:13:37.234 --> 00:13:38.667
-Oh, [bleep] you.

00:13:38.667 --> 00:13:41.200
[ Laughter ]

00:13:44.501 --> 00:13:46.601
See me next week.
Two weeks.

